# Kinsta Provider

An unofficial, community-maintained provider for [Kinsta](https://kinsta.com) WordPress
hosting, built on the [Kinsta API v2](https://api-docs.kinsta.com). It manages sites,
staging environments, site domains and primary domains, and records on Kinsta DNS. It
supports both OpenTofu and Terraform.

Use the full `registry.opentofu.org/solcreek/kinsta` source address with either CLI.

